cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this software in academic work, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "chassis-sim: a chassis-control simulation, observation and reward workbench"
abstract: >-
  A lightweight, reproducible workbench for chassis-level control experiments with
  Ackermann steering, differential drive and mecanum chassis: normalized actions, a
  pure-NumPy simulator with closed-form kinematic integration, a composable observation
  spec, declarative sensors, reference controllers, a benchmark harness and a one-line
  API that makes, evaluates and records an environment. It is deliberately not an
  authoritative physics or contact simulator, and not a multi-agent benchmark suite.
